	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Plura tibi de meis rebus scriberem rationemque omnium rerum redde<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>rem verbosius, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> pater, quo magis iudicares omnia, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quę ex nuper datis ad te literis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Oben <ref target="file11464">Nr. 1421</ref>.</note> cognovisti, ob rerum nostrarum atque <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>opum tenuitatem a nobis esse facta<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p3988">Wolf</persName> bezieht sich auf die ohne Erlaubnis erfolgte Abreise der Zürcher Studenten aus <placeName ref="l512">Tübingen</placeName>; vgl. ebd.</note>, ne videlicet rebus omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>absumptis cum tibi tum aliis dominis nostris rem ingratissimam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nominique nostro turpissimam commisissemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non minus enim a te <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>probari quam diligi semper volui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed breviorem me duę res faciunt: una, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quod prioribus literis omnia illa sim persecutus, altera, quod <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName ref="p8011">Rodolphum Gvaltherum</persName>, familiarem meum et amicum sinceris<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>simum, reliqua omnia suis complexum esse literis<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Oben <ref target="file11473">Nr. 1430</ref>.</note> existimem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Non <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mediusfidius mediocri dolore afficerer, si pristinę laudis meae <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>possessionem amitterem; sed usque mihi temper[abo, ut]<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Text beim Öffnen des Siegels beschädigt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>perducerem eo rem, ut dignum aliquid et vocatione [mea et]<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Text beim Öffnen des Siegels beschädigt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vestra expectatione efficerem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod me<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">me <hi>nachträglich eingefügt.</hi></note> spero, si non [spes]<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Text beim Öffnen des Siegels beschädigt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>fefellerit, consecuturum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quare a te peto maiorem in modum, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ut me per te reliquis meis dominis quam comendatissimum esse <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>velis meumque<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> meamque.</note> in studiorum ratione observanda et in cęteris, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>si quod est in me, studium tibi comendatum esse putes.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quod si <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>feceris, magnus ad tua pristina erga me studia cumulus accedet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Vale salutatis matre<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p7042">Anna, geb. Wiederkehr</persName>.</note>, coniuge<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> et universa familia.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l311">Marpurgi</placeName>, 1540, idibus novembris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Tuus <persName ref="p3988">Iohan. Wolffius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. M. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, dom<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ino suo unice colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
